  what_to_expect_summary = ARRAY['Most users begin noticing subtle changes in stress resilience within the first few weeks of consistent use','Optimal benefits typically develop over 4-8 weeks of daily supplementation','Sleep quality improvements may take longer to manifest, often 6-12 weeks','Individual responses vary based on baseline stress levels and lifestyle factors'],
